  "display_title": "Old Man's Dream",
  "description": "Bom-Hui runs a small art school in her neighbourhood after giving up her dream of becoming a painter. One day, an elderly woman, Chun-Ae, comes to her school. She wants to paint a self-portrait, and she wants to use it as her *memento mori*. \n\nOver the course of ten lessons, Bom-Hui is forced to reflect on her life and her wounds, but will Chun-Ae be able to complete her self-portrait and fulfil her final dream? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
